---
source: tests/cli_root.rs
expression: out
---
Run motion detection and execute an action

Usage: qam watch [OPTIONS] [camera_pos]

Arguments:
  [camera_pos]  Camera name to monitor

Options:
      --action <action>
          Command to execute when motion detected
      --action-template <action-template>
          Optional template to build action command (placeholders: {camera},{score},{time})
      --config <path>
          Path to config file (default: $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/camsnap/config.yaml)
      --camera <camera>
          Camera name to monitor
      --cooldown <cooldown>
          Cooldown between triggering actions [default: 5s]
      --duration <duration>
          Optional max runtime (0 = until interrupted) [default: 0s]
      --json[=<json>]
          Log motion events as JSON lines
      --path <path>
          Custom RTSP path (overrides --stream), e.g., /Bfy... from UniFi Protect
      --rtsp-auth <rtsp-auth>
          RTSP auth mode: auto|basic|digest [default: auto]
      --rtsp-transport <rtsp-transport>
          RTSP transport: tcp|udp [default: tcp]
      --stream <stream>
          RTSP path segment (stream1 or stream2); ignored if --path is set
      --threshold <threshold>
          Scene change threshold (0-1, higher = less sensitive) [default: 0.2]
  -h, --help
          Print help
